# STRIDE DFD: source changes move from an external developer through CI into protected artifact and deployment systems.
threatmodel "CI CD Supply Chain STRIDE"
external Developer: Software Developer
external Registry: Package Registry
process CI: CI Runner
process Deploy: Deployment Service
datastore Source: Source Repository
datastore Artifacts: Artifact Store
datastore Audit: Build Audit Log
Developer -> Source : signed commit
CI -> Source : source checkout
CI -> Registry : dependency download
CI -> Artifacts : signed build artifact
Deploy -> Artifacts : artifact pull
Deploy -> Audit : deployment event
boundary "Developer Internet" { Developer, Registry }
boundary "Build Zone" { CI }
boundary "Production" { Deploy, Source, Artifacts, Audit }
